3DBrailleSignMaker
Heavily modified and expanded derivative work based on previous open-source projects.

Copyright (c) 2026 Alfredo Costa / IFRS Campus Caxias do Sul

Additional development includes:
- New user interface organization
- Portuguese localization improvements
- Latin alphabet + Braille plate generation
- NFC symbol integration for audio description
- Custom plate sizing system
- Accessibility-focused layout improvements
- Printing parameter refinements
- Institutional visual identity adaptations

Based on previous open-source works by:

Evan Wallace (http://madebyevan.com/)
